{"product_id":"sweetness-in-the-belly","title":"Sweetness in the Belly","description":"\u003cp\u003eOrphaned at the age of eight, British-born Lilly studiously devotes her life to the teachings of the Qur'an from within a Moroccan Sufi shrine but is persecuted for her foreign heritage, a situation that remains challenging when she subsequently flees to London and finds herself equally disconnected. By the author of Mouthing the Words. 30,000 first printing.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 148 x 217\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Camilla Gibb\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781594200847\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45199411511449,"sku":"9RG9781594200847","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67c9ba2216b1f_Sweetness_20in_20the_20Belly_20Camilla_20Gibb.jpg?v=1741354654","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/sweetness-in-the-belly","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}